                <div class="gold-card text-white rounded-4 p-4 text-start mb-4 position-relative overflow-hidden">
                    <p class="small text-uppercase mb-1 opacity-75 fw-semibold">Háº¡ng thĂ nh viĂªn</p>
                    <h4 class="fw-bold mb-4">GOLD MEMBER <i class="bi bi-pencil-fill ms-2 fs-6 opacity-50"></i></h4>

                    <p class="small mb-1 opacity-75">Äiá»ƒm tĂ­ch lÅ©y hiá»‡n táº¡i</p>
                    <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">1,250 <span class="fs-6 fw-normal">Ä‘iá»ƒm</span></h2>

                    <div class="progress bg-white bg-opacity-25" style="height: 4px;">
                        <div class="progress-bar bg-white" style="width: 70%"></div>
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-2 mb-0 fw-light" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">CAFECHAIN ELITE</p>
                </div>

                <div class="text-start profile-menu">
                    <a href="/Customer/Profile" class="nav-link rounded-3 p-3 mb-2 text-muted"><i class="bi bi-person me-3"></i> Há»“ sÆ¡ cĂ¡ nhĂ¢n</a>
                    <a href="#" class="nav-link rounded-3 p-3 mb-2 text-muted"><i class="bi bi-clock-history me-3"></i> Lá»‹ch sá»­ Ä‘Æ¡n hĂ ng</a>
                    <a href="#" class="nav-link rounded-3 p-3 mb-2 text-muted"><i class="bi bi-gift me-3"></i> Æ¯u Ä‘Ă£i cá»§a tĂ´i</a>
                    <hr class="my-3 opacity-10">
                    <form asp-controller="Account" asp-action="Logout" method="post">
                        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-light w-100 rounded-3 py-2 text-danger fw-bold"><i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right me-2"></i> ÄÄƒng xuáº¥t tĂ i khoáº£n</button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-md-8">
            <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm rounded-4 p-4 p-md-5">
                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-2">Äá»•i máº­t kháº©u</h3>
                <p class="text-muted small mb-4">VĂ¬ lĂ½ do báº£o máº­t, vui lĂ²ng khĂ´ng chia sáº» máº­t kháº©u cá»§a báº¡n cho ngÆ°á»i khĂ¡c.</p>

                <form id="changePasswordForm">
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <label class="form-label fw-bold small">Máº­t kháº©u hiá»‡n táº¡i</label>
                        <div class="input-group">
                            <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-0"><i class="bi bi-key text-orange"></i></span>
                            <input type="password" id="currentPassword" class="form-control bg-light border-0 py-2 shadow-none" placeholder="â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢">
                            <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-0" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="togglePassword('currentPassword', 'iconCurrent')">
                                <i class="bi bi-eye text-muted" id="iconCurrent"></i>
                            </span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="mb-4 position-relative">
                        <label class="form-label fw-bold small">Máº­t kháº©u má»›i</label>
                        <div class="input-group">
                            <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-0"><i class="bi bi-key text-orange"></i></span>
                            <input type="password" id="newPassword" class="form-control bg-light border-0 py-2 shadow-none" placeholder="â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢â€¢" oninput="validateNewPassword()">
                            <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-0" style="cursor: pointer;" onclick="togglePassword('newPassword', 'iconNew')">
                                <i class="bi bi-eye text-muted" id="iconNew"></i>
                            </span>
